            769,
            772
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " You cannot implement both [`Copy`] and ([`Drop`]|`AsyncDrop`) on the same type. Types that",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            773,
            867
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
          "doc_text": " are `Copy` get implicitly duplicated by the compiler, making it very",
          "path": "doc",
          "range": [
            868,
            940
          ],
          "style": "outer"
        },
        {
